# Unwilling Vessel, "Eerie - Whenever an enchantment you control enters and whenever you fully unlock a Room, put a possession
# counter on this creature": Underwater Tunnel cast as its left door on turn 3 enters as an enchantment (1 counter); unlocking
# the other door, Slimy Aquarium, on the same turn fully unlocks the Room (CR 709.5h) for a second counter (2 in all). The Room
# entering with only one door unlocked is not a full unlock, so it adds exactly one.

